{"id":"celos","lemma":"celos","pos":"noun","rank":2615,"glosses":["jealousy","rut"],"ipa":"/ˈθelos/","gender":"m","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/78/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-celos.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tenía celos de mi hermano.","en":"I was jealous of my brother.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/330717","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"brother"}]},{"text":"Ellos tienen celos de nuestro éxito.","en":"They are jealous of our success.","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"our, ours, to us"},{"g":"success"}]},{"text":"Tiene muchos celos de su mujer.","en":"He's very jealous of his wife.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"woman"}]},{"text":"La gente celosa muere pero los celos no.","en":"Jealous people die, but not jealousy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/768259","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"people"},{"g":"jealous","l":"celoso"},{"g":"to die","l":"morir"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"no / not"}]},{"text":"Tienen celos de nosotros.","en":"They are jealous of us.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"we"}]}]}